@startuml
title Sample Sequence - Ordering a Flat White

actor Customer
participant "Barista" as Barista
participant "Espresso Machine" as Machine
database "Loyalty Card" as Card

Customer -> Barista: One flat white, please
Barista -> Card: Stamp it
Card --> Barista: Nine stamps, one to go
Barista -> Machine: Pull a double shot
Machine --> Barista: Crema, as nature intended
Barista --> Customer: Flat white, no foam art questions

@enduml
